message: "If you use this software or its derived research outputs, cite the archived release and the underlying datasets listed in DATA_LICENSE.md."
title: "Indonesia Wildfire Analysis: matched satellite-observation evidence for Kalimantan"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Indonesia Wildfire Analysis contributors"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shiverion/indonesia-wildfire-analysis"
url: "https://github.com/Shiverion/indonesia-wildfire-analysis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - Kalimantan
  - remote sensing
  - land-cover change
  - VIIRS
  - MapBiomas
  - peatland
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, quality receipts, statistical results, and a static
  evidence explorer for a Kalimantan matched satellite-observation study.
  Phase 3 estimates temporal associations between index-day active-fire
  detection and later mapped natural-forest loss; it does not identify an
  ignition actor, intent, ownership, legality, or economic benefit.
